# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Profi Pereezd — environment
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# LEAD DELIVERY (required — without both, every form returns 503)
#
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather and copy the token here.
# 2. Add the bot to the group that should receive leads, make it an admin.
# 3. Get the chat id: send any message in the group, then open
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates and read
#    result[].message.chat.id — group ids are negative, e.g. -1001234567890.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANALYTICS
#
# Nothing is required here. The site emits every conversion event to
# `window.dataLayer`, `gtag` and `fbq` if they exist (see src/lib/analytics.ts),
# so GTM / GA4 / Meta Pixel can be added later via the host or a <Script> tag
# with no code change.
#
# Events emitted:
#   hero_form · price_calculator · service_cta · final_cta
#   phone_click · telegram_click · whatsapp_click · sticky_mobile_cta
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
